OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies urged not to miss out on
OL,4,Afree school meals
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies are being urged to check their
OL,7,Feligibility for free school meals
OL,8,Ffollowing national changes coming into
OL,9,Fforce.
OL,11,FFrom September, the previous earnings
OL,12,Fthreshold for Universal Credit
OL,13,Fclaimants is being removed, so all
OL,14,Fhouseholds receiving the support can
OL,15,Fapply regardless of income.
OL,17,FWestmorland and Furness Council has
OL,18,Fissued a reminder that this is not
OL,19,Fawarded automatically and has urged all
OL,20,Faffected families to register.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
